> Every June, WIM / MedSpan sponsors a health-[themed] street fair featuring local music, food, art projects, theater and games along with health awareness programs. This event is now a tradition born in 2012 with the inaugural event conceived by international artist Miralda to celebrate the opening of the new[ clinic] building on South Street and the culturally rich neighborhood.
